## init-remaining-operators.soar -- selection-world: 1 proposal, 1 application.

## ---- operator proposal ----

## Propose init-remaining-operators.
sp {selection-world*propose*selection*init-remaining-operators
   :default
   (state <s> ^name selection
             -^remaining-operators
              ^item-count <item-count>)
-->
   (<s> ^operator <operator> + =, >)
   (<operator> ^name init-remaining-operators
               ^value <item-count>)
}

## ---- operator application ----

## Apply init-remaining-operators -> sets remaining-operator.
sp {selection-world*apply*init-remaining-operators
   :default
   (state <s> ^operator <operator>)
   (<operator> ^name init-remaining-operators
               ^value <item-count>)
-->
   (<s> ^remaining-operators <item-count>)
}
